Parts from other authors:

- fm1-base (https://github.com/charlesvestal/fm1-base), a git submodule, MPL-2.0, Copyright (C) 2026 Charles Vestal
  and the other authors named in its CREDITS.md: the Bluetooth shim and the MIDI service (ble/), which the module is
  built from. patches/fm1-base/ changes some of its files (MPL-2.0, as the files). module/fble_mod.c follows its
