- JieLi AC79 SDK (https://gitee.com/Jieli-Tech/fw-AC79_AIoT_SDK), Copyright (c) JIELI (Zhuhai Jieli Technology Co.,
  Ltd.), Apache License 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). None of it is in this repository; the build reads it from
  your SDK checkout. A built module (build/fble.img) contains, in object form:
    - JieLi's Bluetooth libraries btctrler.a, btstack.a, crypto_toolbox_Osize.a, wl_rf_common.a, lib_ccm_aes.a
      (binary only in the SDK). btctrler.a, btstack.a and crypto_toolbox_Osize.a are linked from copies with
      objects removed (tools/build_module.py diet_libs: profiles the module does not use);
    - the SDK sources fm1-base's build compiles for Bluetooth, some with constants changed by
      tools/build_module.py (its LEVERS: log lines off, smaller heaps, queues, stacks and connection counts);
    - parts of the SDK repeated in fm1-base's ble/ and in module/fble_stubs.c, as their headers say;
    - libcompiler_rt.a, as shipped in the SDK (LLVM compiler-rt: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).

- fble2 (branch fble2, a prototype: module2/, docs/FBLE2-PLAN.md) uses none of JieLi's libraries. It contains:
    - optimist-ble/ble/: Optimist's Bluetooth stack (https://github.com/w0ts/optimist, firmware/src/ble/ at commit
      fcdc4881e878), Copyright (C) 2026 the Optimist contributors (Henri David, @hdavid, and others), offered as
      "GPL-3.0-only OR MPL-2.0" and used here under MPL-2.0 (LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt). Unchanged; the SPDX lines kept;
    - bsp-radio/: felucca-bsp's radio headers (https://github.com/hugelton/felucca-bsp, chip/ at 305c372, the
      drivers from Optimist brought in by Charles Vestal in 606c9b2): fm1_ble.h and fm1_ble_rf.h, "GPL-3.0-only OR
      MPL-2.0", used under MPL-2.0; fm1_rf_cal.h, Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) Zhuhai Jieli Technology Co., Ltd. and
      Copyright (C) 2026 Charles Vestal (the radio calibration, rewritten from JieLi's wl_rf_common.a);
      ble_rf_tables_v15.h, Apache-2.0, the radio start-up values captured from M-VAVE's FM-1 V15 firmware
      (Copyright (c) 2026 Zhuhai Shengke / M-VAVE, published under Apache-2.0 in m-vave/fm1_open). Unchanged.
  No GPL-3.0-only file of Optimist is in it: module2/hal/ is this repository's own (MPL-2.0).

- SLOOP (https://github.com/isod89/sloop-fm1), GPL-3.0 (LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt), Copyright (C) 2026 Leo Kuroshita
